sequenceDiagram
    participant Coordinator
    participant North
    participant South
    participant East
    par Notify north
        Coordinator->>North: Update
    and Notify south
        Coordinator->>South: Update
    and Notify east
        Coordinator->>East: Update
    end
    par_over Collect the replies
        North-->>Coordinator: Ack
    and South side
        South-->>Coordinator: Ack
    end
    North-->>Coordinator: Done
